.git
.gitignore
.codex
.obsidian
.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
node_modules
**/node_modules
# Generated inside the API Dockerfile; local TypeScript generation must not invalidate COPY/cache.
apps/api/src/generated
dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
coverage
**/coverage
.turbo
**/.turbo
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
docs/.obsidian/workspace*.json
docs/_attachments

# Test sources are never part of a runtime image, and no Dockerfile runs them. Keeping them out of
# the build context stops a spec that reaches outside its package (e.g. into scripts/) from breaking
# `turbo run build` inside a deliberately minimal image context, and keeps compiled specs out of dist.
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.ts
# ...except the one spec the migration-tool image ships on purpose: that image copies raw
# apps/api/src and runs .ts through tsx, and infra/security/verify-production-a5-migration-tool.sh
# fails the release if this path is absent. Service images stay spec-free.
!apps/api/src/scripts/production-a5-reimbursement-compatibility.pg.spec.ts
